#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:114
msgid ""
"Base exception raised for any error returned by the modem or the driver."
msgstr ""
"Osnovna iznimka koja se podiže za bilo kakvu pogrešku koju vrati modem ili "
"upravljački program."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:118
msgid ""
"Raised when the modem does not respond within the configured timeout (the "
"receive buffer is empty)."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kada modem ne odgovori unutar konfiguriranog vremena čekanja "
"(međuspremnik za primanje je prazan)."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:123
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_PARAM`` response when an AT command was issued with an "
"invalid parameter."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_PARAM`` odgovora kada je AT naredba izdana s nevažećim "
"parametrom."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:128
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_BUSY`` response when the modem is busy processing a "
"previous command."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_BUSY`` odgovora kada je modem zauzet obradom prethodne "
"naredbe."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:133
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_PARAM_OVERFLOW`` response when a parameter exceeds the "
"maximum allowed length."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_PARAM_OVERFLOW`` odgovora kada parametar premašuje "
"najveću dopuštenu duljinu."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:138
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_NO_NETWORK`` response when the modem has not joined a "
"network."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_NO_NETWORK`` odgovora kada se modem nije pridružio "
"mreži."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:143
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_RX`` response when an error occurs while receiving a "
"downlink."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_RX`` odgovora kada dođe do pogreške tijekom primanja "
"silazne veze."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:148
msgid ""
"Raised on a ``+ERR_UNKNOWN`` response or when the modem reports an "
"undocumented error."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kod ``+ERR_UNKNOWN`` odgovora ili kada modem prijavi "
"nedokumentiranu pogrešku."

#: ../../library/omv.lora.rst:153
